        },
        {
          "text": "Palwa bena Hebuloni, Yeria ewali intungulushi umo batantamine ukulingana ne cifyalilwa ca bashibo. Mu mwaka walenga amakumi yane (40) uwakwa Davidi pa bufumu, bafwailishe mu ndupwa sha bena Hebuloni elyo basangamo impalume ishakosa ku Yaseri wa mu Gileadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.31"
            ]
          }
        },
